# Silhouette (CR 615.1, 120.2b, 514.2): "Choose target creature. If a spell or ability that targets that creature would cause a
# source to deal damage to that creature this turn, prevent that damage." Any creature may be chosen: on turn 3 Bot1 casts it on
# Bot2's Aegis Turtle (0/5) - not on Bot2's Island, no creature. Bot1's Prodigal Sorcerer's ability then targets the Turtle, and its
# 1 damage is prevented. The effect lasts only the turn: on turn 5 the same ability deals the Turtle 1 damage.

